{"statements": ["Entry‑level cloud‑engineer positions across the listed postings consistently look for a mix of cloud platform knowledge, programming/scripting ability, infrastructure‑as‑code experience, and basic systems/DevOps skills.", "Experience with AWS is most common, with Azure and Google Cloud also noted.", "Infrastructure‑as‑Code experience includes Terraform, CloudFormation, Ansible, or similar tools.", "Containers & orchestration experience includes Kubernetes and container‑based workloads.", "Programming/scripting skills include Python and Bash/Shell scripting, and C# in one posting.", "CI/CD pipeline experience includes building, maintaining, and automating pipelines such as GitHub and other CI/CD tools.", "Linux systems administration expertise, often with Ansible or similar configuration management.", "Data‑related services experience includes working with databases (PostgreSQL), S3, Glue, Athena, Lambda, and data‑pipeline/ML‑Ops concepts.", "Automation & troubleshooting ability to automate deployments, monitor systems, and resolve issues.", "Communication & collaboration skills include strong written/verbal abilities and teamwork orientation.", "Education typically requires a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field."], "verdicts": [{"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}], "verbose_logs": "Statements:
