    "Infrastructure‑as‑Code experience includes Terraform, CloudFormation, Ansible, or similar tools.",
    "Containers & orchestration experience includes Kubernetes and container‑based workloads.",
    "Programming/scripting skills include Python and Bash/Shell scripting, and C# in one posting.",
    "CI/CD pipeline experience includes building, maintaining, and automating pipelines such as GitHub and other CI/CD tools.",
    "Linux systems administration expertise, often with Ansible or similar configuration management.",
    "Data‑related services experience includes working with databases (PostgreSQL), S3, Glue, Athena, Lambda, and data‑pipeline/ML‑Ops concepts.",
    "Automation & troubleshooting ability to automate deployments, monitor systems, and resolve issues.",
    "Communication & collaboration skills include strong written/verbal abilities and teamwork orientation.",
    "Education typically requires a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field."
] 

