    "CompTIA Network+ or other certifications are optional but advantageous.",
    "Work environment is mostly office‑based or remote with occasional on‑site days, e.g., 3 days per month.",
    "Full‑time schedule, often 8 am‑4 pm or similar, is typical."
] 

